sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Main as Composition root
    participant Runner as Entry runner
    participant Startup as Entry point
    participant Log as Command middleware
    participant Handler as Command handler
    participant Planner as Domain service

    Main->>+Runner: every Entry, until the first ends
    Runner->>+Startup: the startup entry
    Note over Startup: reads its setting into the command
    Startup->>+Log: the command, through the command middleware
    Note over Log: record "command called"
    Log->>+Handler: the command
    Handler->>+Planner: the titles
    Planner-->>-Handler: open items, or an error with its kind
    Handler-->>-Log: the result, or the error
    Note over Log: record "command handled" or "command failed"
    Log-->>-Startup: the result, or the error
    Note over Startup: writes the result as one JSON line
    Startup-->>-Runner: nil, or the error
    Runner-->>-Main: the exit code: 0, 2 for invalid, 1 for a failure
